ot_5.jpg","https://content2.prod.catalog.playfab.com/pf-namespace-b63a0803d3653643/292de83d-c558-49ff-b731-0f5f6d1bf615/Allay_screenshot_6.jpg","https://content2.prod.catalog.playfab.com/pf-namespace-b63a0803d3653643/137c3ccb-202f-440a-963c-8b2852e7f899/Allay_screenshot_7.jpg","https://content2.prod.catalog.playfab.com/pf-namespace-b63a0803d3653643/f348719e-9b9a-47fc-910e-7798eb629e6c/Allay_screenshot_8.jpg","https://content2.prod.catalog.playfab.com/pf-namespace-b63a0803d3653643/70c57087-98ac-4e96-857f-c302c164279c/Allay_screenshot_9.jpg"],"version":"1.0.13","changelog":null,"lastModifiedDate":"2026-09-17T15:49:11.942Z","faqEntries":null,"howToTitle":"Allay Allies How-To","howToEntries":[{"heading":"Finding Allays","content":"To get started, simply explore your world and keep an eye out for the unique altars where each type of Allay can be found and tamed or summoned with a ritual."},{"heading":"Taming Allays","content":"Each Allay has their own item to tame with. Simply interact with the Allay while holding their required item to attempt to tame it and make it your ally! All Allay types and their tame items are listed in the in-game guide book."},{"heading":"Summoning Allays","content":"Allay Altars can also be used to summon more of that type of Allay. To begin, ensure the Altar has the required blocks beneath it, in a 3x3 platform. Then place the required sacrifice item onto the Altar, and wait for Midnight, when the ritual will begin. If the ritual is a success, a new Allay will appear, waiting to be tamed, but if it fails, a hostile Vex will appear! A list of all altar blocks and sacrifice items for each type of Allay can be found in the in-game guide book."}],"tags":["bd8215bd-3b57-4fb2-9961-0bffec9f0964","a81e86dc-a5bf-49bd-ae8a-582907d65f27","2d96da7f-bc8c-4d3c-8760-d695296b9510","tag.collect","tag.mob","tag.pet","tag.shiny","tag.tame","tag.treasure","tag.utilities","tag.cute","video_trailer","3P","addon","genre.survival","tag.vibrantvisuals","vvenhanced"],